Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sealed Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 28
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.43,0:00:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll stand guard outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.78,0:00:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so I won’t get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll stay behind too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll feel at ease knowing you’re holding the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s set off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this where Mom used to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.51,0:00:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a shame Big Sister couldn’t finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.39,0:00:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s help her finish it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This door won’t open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s split up and look for the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.94,0:01:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The door is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.67,0:01:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss and the others are catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s settle this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.83,0:02:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, charge with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so dark here; it’s terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is there to be afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.39,0:02:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined there would be such a huge space underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like this place has been through a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A disaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine. Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This place feels so high-tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.70,0:03:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just like an alien spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t grab me! Don’t grab me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve never seen machine parts like these before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though our world is extremely technologically advanced…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But this invention of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,will make all the world’s technology pale in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s just a projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary Aqua Pearl—here I come
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the Aqua Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.66,0:04:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,a scientist, seeking to rule the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.30,0:04:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,created the Aqua Pearl, capable of absorbing all water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder there’s no water in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out it was all sucked up by that Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, so we need to take the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t we still have water?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why go to such great lengths to get the Aqua Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I never told you…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but we’re actually running low on water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we get the Aqua Pearl,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll have an endless supply of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can make the whole world bow down to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You found your way here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for opening the door for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.97,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The robots are moving—everyone watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t get tangled up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.81,0:06:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.84,0:06:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch, ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like three lights need to be lit up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,before this door will open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we need to find the other two switches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll help look for them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let go of the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to keep pressing it to keep the light on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the robots are closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys find the switches; I’ll hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there’s a switch over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There actually is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s one down here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know that so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know; I’m just following my intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.11,0:07:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s some impressive intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The door is opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, you three go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s all go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to hold the switches down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the door will close immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what about you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate us—see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the way for the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about getting past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s no way forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That is…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s the thing Mom has been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let it fall into their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.23,0:08:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we are the main characters, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You two shouldn’t let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s there to fear? We’ve got you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You wouldn’t let anything bad happen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.22,0:09:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.35,0:09:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.90,0:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re awake. I thought you wouldn’t boot up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:10:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The scan revealed quite a bit of data corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems positive emotions help repair the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the repairs are complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll be able to find a way into the underground lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? And who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me Dr. Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,As for you…your name is Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei…I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,a king and queen had a beautiful little princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The people in the books all have moms and dads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I have a mom and dad, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.59,0:10:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then…would you be willing to be my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I’d love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.58,0:11:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, my darling daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.78,0:11:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s my favorite doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The candles are about to go out; make a wish first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Mom’s wish comes true—finding the legendary Aqua Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly child, it’s called the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Aqua Pearl is crucial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, I can control all the water sources in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and control the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.22,0:11:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must guard the Aqua Pearl with your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Overloaded; unable to continue collecting water
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Overloaded; unable to continue collecting water
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Overloaded
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.59,0:11:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How is she still able to move?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
